    <Description>3 skill BK combo (Fast Combo)
BK 3 Skills Fast Combo

1st Skill Order
1. Cyclone Slash( Weapon Skill)
2. Twisting slash.
3. Death Stab

2nd Skill Order
1. Cyclone Slash( Weapon Skill)
2. Death Stab
3. Twisting slash.

3rd Skill Order
1. Cyclone Slash( Weapon Skill)
2. Rageful Blow
3. Twisting slash.

4th Skill Order
1. Cyclone Slash( Weapon Skill)
2. Strik of Destruction
3. Twisting slash.




This combo will effect Between 90 to 120 RTT.
If RTT is above 150 to 200 this combo is not effective.
In order to achive 90 to 120 RTT you need a ping reducer program.

Best for Duel and PK</Description>
